<title>USA: Bank of New York to buy custody business.</title>
<headline>Bank of New York to buy custody business.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of New York Co. Inc. said on Wednesday it had signed a definitive agreement to purchase the institutional custody and Taft-Hartley custody businesses of Wells Fargo and Co..</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed. Bank of New York said the deal is expected to add about $75 billion to its assets under custody, which now total more than $3 trillion.</p>
</text>
